 ◆ self-host                                                              v1.0.0

  Your own web address

  ╭─────────────╮      ╭────────────╮      ╭───────────────╮
  │ anyone with │──────│ Cloudflare │──────│ this computer │
  │ the address │      │ login page │      │ no open port  │
  ╰─────────────╯      ╰─────┬──────╯      ╰───────────────╯
                       login first ✓

  Your own web address, like movies.example.com, opens your chosen Apps from
  anywhere through Cloudflare Tunnel, without opening any port on your router.
  A login page stands in front, so only people you allow get in. Choose Apps
  after they are installed; nothing goes public without a separate yes.

  Before you begin
  Add your main domain to Cloudflare and wait until it is active. At
  one.dash.cloudflare.com choose a team name, the Zero Trust Free plan (50
  users), and a payment method that is not charged. Use the main domain, not a
  sub-domain: deeper names need a paid certificate.

